  "Born at Castletown Berehaven, County Cork, on 18 September 1846; he was educated at Trinity College Dublin and practised law before History of Ireland: Heroic Period (1878) made him the herald of the Irish revival. Cuculain and His Contemporaries (1880), The Story of Ireland (1894) and The Bog of Stars (1893) followed. He died on the Isle of Wight on 18 May 1928.",
